<title>AUSTRIA: Austria currency reserves down 0.91 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Austria currency reserves down 0.91 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian foreign currency reserves fell 0.91 percent to 202.406 billion schillings ($16.8 billion) in February, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274 ($ = 12.03 Austrian Schillings)</p>
</text>
